WEBVTT

01:41.450 --> 01:45.979
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.539 --> 01:49.020
[Episode 24]

01:50.280 --> 01:51.759
If you still consider me as your master,

01:53.150 --> 01:53.870
promise me,

01:55.070 --> 01:56.560
don't be held back by anything.

01:57.950 --> 01:59.280
Be as free as a bird.

02:10.240 --> 02:10.800
Master.

02:11.560 --> 02:12.150
Ranran!

02:13.910 --> 02:14.400
Ranran.

02:15.010 --> 02:16.520
Master, Mr. Yu Tong, and Mr. Yu Chen

02:16.520 --> 02:17.400
are all gone this morning.

02:17.960 --> 02:19.100
Master left me a note

02:19.360 --> 02:20.520
saying he's never coming back.

02:20.680 --> 02:21.560
What?

02:22.000 --> 02:22.380
Well...

02:23.310 --> 02:24.400
-Mr. Zeng.
-Mr. Zeng.

02:25.030 --> 02:25.590
Mr. Zeng.

02:26.000 --> 02:26.680
Where's Master?

02:26.800 --> 02:27.710
Where has Master gone?

02:28.840 --> 02:29.840
Your master

02:29.870 --> 02:30.750
has urgent matters to attend to.

02:31.280 --> 02:32.310
He has already left Mount Wester.

02:33.079 --> 02:34.190
Before leaving, he entrusted me,

02:34.820 --> 02:35.770
if you want to go home,

02:35.800 --> 02:36.630
he has prepared travel expenses for you.

02:37.240 --> 02:38.630
If you want to join other sects,

02:39.360 --> 02:40.430
he has also written letters of recommendation.

02:43.520 --> 02:44.630
Master said he had urgent matters to attend to.

02:45.750 --> 02:47.150
Has he gone to seal the Spirit Spring?

02:49.840 --> 02:51.079
Seal the Spirit Spring?

02:51.700 --> 02:53.350
When did Master plan to do this?

02:53.910 --> 02:55.630
Actually, last time in Puxin Village,

02:55.920 --> 02:57.110
the Nine-Headed Kui'ao we encountered

02:57.710 --> 02:58.470
took away the stele

02:58.470 --> 02:59.630
for sealing the Spirit Spring.

03:00.430 --> 03:01.120
Mr. Zeng,

03:01.750 --> 03:02.680
is that true?

03:06.280 --> 03:06.710
Yes.

03:08.310 --> 03:09.680
Sealing the Spirit Spring is urgent.

03:10.280 --> 03:11.280
He now urgently needs

03:11.280 --> 03:11.870
to find the gate to the netherworld.

03:13.870 --> 03:15.310
But I haven't returned the soul

03:15.310 --> 03:16.150
to Master yet.

03:16.910 --> 03:18.590
How can Master, with a part of his spiritual soul missing,

03:19.150 --> 03:20.079
manage to

03:20.079 --> 03:21.120
suppress the Spirit Spring alone?

03:23.360 --> 03:24.400
He is Su Yishui.

03:24.750 --> 03:25.470
He has his own ways.

03:26.150 --> 03:27.190
Missing a strand of spiritual soul

03:27.430 --> 03:28.150
only hinders his ascension

03:28.150 --> 03:29.190
to godhood,

03:29.470 --> 03:29.910
right?

03:34.000 --> 03:35.190
Why do I feel like

03:35.560 --> 03:37.030
Master is saying a final farewell?

03:39.870 --> 03:41.520
I don't believe

03:41.710 --> 03:42.190
he would leave us disciples behind

03:42.190 --> 03:43.310
if he was really confident.

03:49.360 --> 03:49.960
Mr. Zeng,

03:51.440 --> 03:52.370
are you hiding something

03:52.400 --> 03:53.030
from us?

03:55.840 --> 03:56.590
Once you leave,

03:56.960 --> 03:58.030
there's no turning back.

03:59.120 --> 04:00.520
Don't you want to say goodbye to Ranran?

04:03.080 --> 04:04.030
She has always been clever.

04:04.470 --> 04:05.280
If she senses anything,

04:05.360 --> 04:06.150
I'll have trouble getting away.

04:07.750 --> 04:08.910
This matter is too dangerous.

04:09.360 --> 04:10.680
I can't let Ranran get involved.

04:11.630 --> 04:12.400
She's a girl

04:13.010 --> 04:14.680
who has always loved freedom.

04:15.750 --> 04:16.800
Tea Inscription Mountain is a good place.

04:17.390 --> 04:18.000
Why don't you take her

04:18.000 --> 04:18.829
to open a wine shop?

04:19.750 --> 04:20.510
All the money of the Wester Sect

04:20.529 --> 04:21.730
is stored in the rice container in the dining room.

04:23.830 --> 04:24.510
Stiffly Su,

04:25.600 --> 04:26.510
actually,

04:26.800 --> 04:28.120
there might be other ways.

04:29.070 --> 04:30.390
Let's figure it out together.

04:31.000 --> 04:32.310
It doesn't necessarily have to be you.

04:32.800 --> 04:33.390
Besides,

04:33.630 --> 04:34.720
Ranran has already gone to find a way

04:34.750 --> 04:35.950
to return your soul.

04:36.720 --> 04:37.360
Just wait a little longer.

04:38.510 --> 04:39.159
I have one last drop

04:40.600 --> 04:41.720
of the Spirit Spring left.

04:43.120 --> 04:44.360
I need to end this fate.

04:48.240 --> 04:48.870
Senior Zeng,

04:50.630 --> 04:51.510
I'll leave her in your care.

04:53.510 --> 04:54.270
How could that be?

04:55.210 --> 04:56.090
It's your master.

04:56.120 --> 04:56.950
You know him best.

04:57.480 --> 04:58.560
He's such a cold fish,

04:58.830 --> 04:59.920
acting on every whim.

05:00.390 --> 05:01.000
Perhaps,

05:01.390 --> 05:02.560
after he seals the Spirit Spring,

05:02.680 --> 05:03.720
he might just find a quiet place

05:03.750 --> 05:04.430
to cultivate.

05:04.870 --> 05:05.390
Anyway,

05:05.520 --> 05:06.130
he has already arranged everything

05:06.160 --> 05:07.120
for you all.

05:07.560 --> 05:08.030
You,

05:08.240 --> 05:09.390
go to Tea Inscription Mountain with me.

05:09.750 --> 05:10.920
I don't want to go anywhere!

05:11.680 --> 05:13.360
Master took me to plant trees on Mount Wester.

05:14.120 --> 05:15.070
He said the place where we planted trees

05:15.070 --> 05:16.190
would be my home.

05:17.160 --> 05:18.630
Why didn't he keep his word?

05:19.160 --> 05:20.070
Why did he have to leave?

05:20.600 --> 05:21.950
Did he want to avoid me that much?

05:23.630 --> 05:24.190
Ranran.

05:24.830 --> 05:25.120
Ran...

05:26.530 --> 05:27.040
Ranran,

05:27.070 --> 05:28.630
don't be sad all by yourself.

05:29.680 --> 05:30.160
Xi'er,

05:31.160 --> 05:32.409
let her be alone for a while.

05:58.000 --> 05:58.720
Ling Xiao,

06:01.370 --> 06:02.570
who am I really?

06:04.160 --> 06:06.000
What does Master take me for?

06:06.950 --> 06:08.110
Can you tell me?

06:21.190 --> 06:21.800
Ling Xiao,

06:22.480 --> 06:23.310
have I entered your memories

06:23.310 --> 06:24.240
again?

06:25.630 --> 06:26.160
Then,

06:27.680 --> 06:28.920
these are Master's memories?

06:36.760 --> 06:37.610
It's Master.

06:45.220 --> 06:47.830
There's no Reincarnation Tree on this mountain yet.

06:48.780 --> 06:49.510
Was it

06:50.190 --> 06:51.190
19 years ago?

06:52.720 --> 06:53.430
Qingge is dead.

06:53.450 --> 06:54.840
Why can you be alive in this world?

06:55.280 --> 06:56.040
Young Master Yu.

06:57.210 --> 06:58.090
I'm going to kill you

06:58.120 --> 06:59.159
to avenge Qingge!

07:13.120 --> 07:15.040
Qingge could never be the Demon's child.

07:16.120 --> 07:17.680
The Demon's child is someone else.

07:18.270 --> 07:19.000
Tell me,

07:19.920 --> 07:21.040
for whom did Qingge

07:22.120 --> 07:23.160
take on this false accusation?

07:25.200 --> 07:26.230
Of course, she wasn't.

07:28.680 --> 07:30.070
The real Demon's child is...

07:32.470 --> 07:33.560
You can't say it.

07:34.750 --> 07:35.510
It's you,

07:35.510 --> 07:36.830
the ungrateful scumbag,

07:37.630 --> 07:38.159
right?

07:40.430 --> 07:42.159
You resented her for siding with me,

07:43.370 --> 07:44.400
so you made her

07:44.430 --> 07:45.120
bear this terrible accusation

07:45.140 --> 07:46.220
for you.

07:47.920 --> 07:48.600
Don't forget,

07:49.560 --> 07:51.159
if there's still one person in this world

07:51.190 --> 07:52.360
who cares whether you're alive,

07:54.720 --> 07:55.830
it's your master,

07:57.190 --> 07:57.920
Mu Qingge.

08:01.510 --> 08:02.240
But you

08:04.560 --> 08:06.190
killed her with your own hands.

08:08.110 --> 08:09.310
Why did you have to compete with me?

08:10.390 --> 08:11.430
If you hadn't done so,

08:14.190 --> 08:15.160
she wouldn't have ended up dead.

08:17.200 --> 08:18.600
Prince Ping's entire army has been wiped out.

08:18.630 --> 08:19.390
You've lost.

08:21.270 --> 08:22.430
I told you long ago

08:24.120 --> 08:25.190
that you had no chance of winning.

08:26.160 --> 08:27.510
And now, you've even

08:27.510 --> 08:28.480
sacrificed Qingge's life!

08:36.150 --> 08:37.030
She's not dead.

08:39.440 --> 08:40.720
Her spiritual soul hasn't perished.

08:41.669 --> 08:43.120
I won't let her dissipate.

08:43.720 --> 08:44.240
Your Highness,

08:45.360 --> 08:46.270
on Jade Peak of Sky Mountain,

08:46.550 --> 08:47.550
there is a Reincarnation Tree.

08:48.390 --> 08:49.840
If we can offer a Golden Core as a sacrifice,

08:50.360 --> 08:51.790
we can bring her primordial spirit back to life.

08:54.270 --> 08:55.600
Retrieve Qingge's spiritual soul.

09:01.240 --> 09:02.720
I will help her raise from the dead.

09:03.510 --> 09:04.790
No one else will take her away.

09:05.790 --> 09:06.670
Do you think after she's resurrected,

09:06.670 --> 09:07.720
she'll still want to see you?

09:08.390 --> 09:09.840
The person she always loved is me.

09:10.220 --> 09:11.810
Even if it's to bring Qingge's spiritual soul back to life,

09:11.840 --> 09:13.080
I should be the one to protect it!

09:14.930 --> 09:16.410
What gives you the right to make decisions on your own

09:16.440 --> 09:17.120
and trap her?

09:18.790 --> 09:19.390
You're not worthy.

09:20.750 --> 09:21.750
You must have known my identity

09:21.750 --> 09:22.440
earlier.

09:24.480 --> 09:26.510
Yet you deliberately used Qingge to provoke me,

09:27.960 --> 09:28.480
didn't you?

09:31.530 --> 09:32.000
You knew

09:32.030 --> 09:33.390
only she could stop me.

09:35.200 --> 09:36.750
You included her in your schemes.

09:38.390 --> 09:39.320
What kind of love is that?

09:41.510 --> 09:42.390
You and I are the same.

09:43.910 --> 09:45.240
We're both the ones she shouldn't be close to

09:46.150 --> 09:47.200
in her reincarnation.

09:50.630 --> 09:52.240
Turns out Master and Young Master Yu

09:52.630 --> 09:53.750
had such a history.

09:55.630 --> 09:56.510
I've long known

09:56.510 --> 09:57.750
that Master deeply loves Grandmaster,

09:58.840 --> 10:00.120
but after I saw it with my own eyes,

10:01.200 --> 10:02.000
why do I

10:02.000 --> 10:03.030
still feel so painful?

10:17.790 --> 10:18.870
Master has already brought back

10:18.870 --> 10:19.750
the Reincarnation Tree.

10:23.390 --> 10:24.960
There are two Reincarnation Fruits on the tree.

10:25.910 --> 10:27.150
Could one of them be me?

10:33.630 --> 10:34.270
Master!

10:34.630 --> 10:36.030
Master, are you hurting?

10:39.270 --> 10:40.670
When will Master be able to return?

10:41.870 --> 10:43.270
The Reincarnation Tree defies the heavens.

10:44.000 --> 10:45.750
It will take 18 years for her to be back to life.

10:47.150 --> 10:48.030
You're severely injured.

10:48.720 --> 10:50.080
You need to go into seclusion to save your life.

10:51.140 --> 10:51.690
During these 18 years,

10:51.720 --> 10:52.840
if anything happens,

10:53.440 --> 10:54.360
how will you protect her?

10:55.750 --> 10:56.550
I have my own ways.

11:01.190 --> 11:02.600
Why are you extracting your own spiritual soul?

11:14.240 --> 11:15.840
After this, I will seclude myself and lose all five senses.

11:16.510 --> 11:17.390
This part of my spiritual soul

11:18.030 --> 11:19.030
can accompany her.

11:30.480 --> 11:31.550
This is Ling Xiao.

11:33.270 --> 11:35.240
Master gave Ling Xiao to Master Mu.

11:39.910 --> 11:41.360
If Master had Ling Xiao stay

11:41.870 --> 11:42.990
in order to protect Mu Qingge,

11:44.270 --> 11:45.480
why is it with me?

11:47.000 --> 11:47.630
Could I be...

11:49.790 --> 11:50.120
No.

11:51.510 --> 11:52.320
This can't be.

11:53.600 --> 11:54.550
How is this possible?

12:07.320 --> 12:08.870
There must be a hidden chamber here.

12:09.720 --> 12:10.360
Ling Xiao,

12:10.600 --> 12:11.270
help me.

12:18.800 --> 12:20.080
If it's really as I thought,

12:21.080 --> 12:21.720
in my body

12:21.750 --> 12:23.030
is Master's Golden Core.

12:23.720 --> 12:25.150
My spiritual power is connected to Master's.

12:25.670 --> 12:27.270
I should be able to open his hidden chamber.

12:43.000 --> 12:44.510
He kept all the dried longan

12:45.410 --> 12:46.530
I made for Master.

12:51.350 --> 12:52.920
And the pastries I made for him.

12:58.070 --> 12:58.950
The wine I made.

13:07.200 --> 13:09.200
The sect rules Master made me copy as punishment.

13:09.670 --> 13:11.670
Master actually kept all these little things about me

13:12.670 --> 13:13.840
here in this place.

13:22.080 --> 13:22.720
Why are there

13:22.720 --> 13:24.200
so many Sanity Spells here?

13:25.870 --> 13:27.200
I haven't given him

13:27.220 --> 13:28.430
the dried longan I made last time.

13:29.360 --> 13:30.790
Guardian never likes dried longan.

13:31.510 --> 13:32.960
Then I'll leave it on the table.

13:33.390 --> 13:34.630
If Master wants to have some,

13:34.750 --> 13:35.750
he can take it anytime.

14:17.510 --> 14:18.870
Sovereigns of the Wester Sect,

14:20.270 --> 14:21.440
Mu Qingge,

14:22.200 --> 14:23.440
Xue Ranran.

14:26.480 --> 14:27.480
So I am the demoness

14:27.510 --> 14:29.080
everyone talks about,

14:30.390 --> 14:32.200
Mu Qingge, Sovereign of the Wester Sect.

14:42.170 --> 14:43.830
The person Master has been waiting for

14:44.790 --> 14:45.630
is me.

14:46.610 --> 14:53.220
♫Devoting one's life despite knowing it can't be♫

14:50.000 --> 14:51.240
You don't remember anything?

14:53.720 --> 14:54.380
Senior!

14:53.730 --> 14:59.810
♫Coming to the abyss despite knowing retreat is possible♫

14:55.480 --> 14:57.000
What gives you the right to make a scene in my place?

15:00.440 --> 15:01.440
Master,

15:00.610 --> 15:04.100
♫Who says the world is full of wrongs?♫

15:02.240 --> 15:03.470
you're so nice.

15:04.220 --> 15:07.880
♫I seize the Way and choose heaven♫

15:04.540 --> 15:05.750
Once you recall everything,

15:08.850 --> 15:15.560
♫It won't be a waste of my life to burn until I wither♫

15:09.550 --> 15:10.480
you won't forgive me.

15:11.790 --> 15:12.750
Weird.

15:13.360 --> 15:14.960
How did I suddenly

15:15.390 --> 15:16.840
enter Master's Water Mirror?

15:16.290 --> 15:18.990
♫There's no need to discuss right or wrong♫

15:19.200 --> 15:22.850
♫I can sacrifice my life♫

15:19.720 --> 15:20.840
Master, who do you

15:21.560 --> 15:22.960
take me for?

15:23.260 --> 15:26.130
♫All rules can be dismantled♫

15:25.080 --> 15:26.440
Naturally, it's the person

15:26.380 --> 15:29.920
♫Die in this world♫

15:26.480 --> 15:27.550
I've been thinking about for 19 years.

15:30.680 --> 15:34.240
♫The masses spread rumors that are hard to swallow♫

15:31.890 --> 15:33.960
The person I love is clearly right in front of me,

15:34.880 --> 15:37.700
♫I haven't said anything yet, my heart is clear♫

15:36.150 --> 15:37.440
but I can't get her.

15:38.220 --> 15:44.200
♫I still don't regret it; I'll pay for it all my life♫

15:40.390 --> 15:41.200
Mu Qingge,

15:42.480 --> 15:43.080
is this the only way for us

15:43.080 --> 15:44.360
to live our lives in this life?

15:44.610 --> 15:47.490
♫You know my heart, won't go against my wishes♫

15:47.560 --> 15:51.090
♫Don't speak of redressing injustices♫

15:48.320 --> 15:49.510
Master, look carefully

15:50.080 --> 15:51.750
who you kissed!

15:51.540 --> 15:53.860
♫Don't let others pity me♫

15:52.320 --> 15:53.270
Of course, it has always been you!

15:53.880 --> 15:58.340
♫Try your best to forget me♫

15:58.030 --> 15:58.720
Liar.

15:58.930 --> 16:02.340
♫I'll go through hardships and never break down♫

16:00.270 --> 16:01.750
All these years, you've confined yourself,

16:02.600 --> 16:04.200
keeping me in the dark so painfully.

16:02.920 --> 16:06.090
♫I vow to fight against darkness♫

16:06.080 --> 16:07.120
But why

16:06.380 --> 16:12.800
♫Love punishes me a thousand times, yet a merciful heart pardons me♫

16:07.790 --> 16:09.550
did you push me away like this,

16:10.750 --> 16:12.360
given the fact that the person you've been waiting for is me?

16:13.120 --> 16:16.320
♫No pain, no resentment♫

16:34.640 --> 16:41.060
♫Devoting one's life despite knowing it can't be♫

16:34.680 --> 16:35.250
Divine Tree.

16:41.360 --> 16:47.560
♫Coming to the abyss despite knowing retreat is possible♫

16:44.000 --> 16:45.320
I, Su Yishui, hereby take a soul oath.

16:46.270 --> 16:47.000
From today,

16:47.150 --> 16:48.120
I'll join your sect,

16:48.250 --> 16:51.670
♫I'll go through hardships and never break down♫

16:48.440 --> 16:49.270
focus on cultivation,

16:49.290 --> 16:50.170
and never betray you.

16:50.960 --> 16:51.870
Good boy.

16:52.240 --> 16:55.420
♫I vow to fight against darkness♫

16:53.510 --> 16:54.320
The soul oath is completed.

16:55.700 --> 17:02.120
♫Love punishes me a thousand times, yet a merciful heart pardons me♫

17:02.620 --> 17:08.990
♫Only love is the unbreakable spell♫

17:05.720 --> 17:06.349
Master!

17:07.510 --> 17:08.310
Mu Qingge!

17:09.670 --> 17:15.800
♫No need to feel surprised people in the world don't know how to break it♫

17:10.589 --> 17:11.240
No!

17:16.750 --> 17:20.170
♫Sealing your lips, never to speak again♫

17:17.030 --> 17:17.829
I will save you.

17:18.550 --> 17:19.480
I will definitely save you!

17:20.310 --> 17:23.710
♫Even if I were to leap into the abyss♫

17:24.369 --> 17:30.470
♫If you are safe, I would embrace death without a second thought♫

17:41.110 --> 17:42.270
The Qingming Sword has chosen me as its master.

17:43.240 --> 17:44.200
I can actually remember some memories

17:44.200 --> 17:45.440
of my past life.

17:46.640 --> 17:47.680
But why do I

17:48.260 --> 17:49.910
still have a shallow understanding?

17:56.270 --> 17:56.920
Mr. Zeng,

17:58.030 --> 17:58.880
the Qingming Sword has chosen me as its master.

18:02.360 --> 18:03.550
I found this

18:03.550 --> 18:04.350
in Master's room.

18:11.390 --> 18:11.910
Master.

18:12.830 --> 18:13.270
Mr. Zeng,

18:13.510 --> 18:14.240
please don't be like this.

18:15.960 --> 18:17.130
If other fellow disciples see you doing this,

18:17.270 --> 18:17.960
they will be frightened.

18:18.750 --> 18:19.920
I just want to know the truth.

18:20.920 --> 18:22.240
Since you've already guessed,

18:23.000 --> 18:24.110
I can't hide it from you anymore.

18:25.030 --> 18:26.680
So I don't remember anything

18:27.240 --> 18:29.030
because of the Soul-Devouring Lock inside my body.

18:30.290 --> 18:31.850
Master has helped me stabilize my heart

18:31.880 --> 18:33.030
all because of this.

18:36.310 --> 18:37.200
All these years,

18:37.790 --> 18:39.680
he has hoped I would avoid all dangers

18:40.440 --> 18:42.160
and live this life peacefully.

18:43.400 --> 18:44.240
Although I haven't recovered

18:44.240 --> 18:45.400
all my memories,

18:46.310 --> 18:46.960
I know

18:47.350 --> 18:48.720
that neither the former Mu Qingge

18:49.070 --> 18:50.350
nor the current Xue Ranran

18:51.090 --> 18:51.610
wants

18:51.640 --> 18:52.790
him to bear everything alone.

18:54.640 --> 18:55.680
Can you tell me now

18:56.110 --> 18:57.070
where Master has gone?

18:58.070 --> 18:59.240
I really don't know.

18:59.910 --> 19:00.670
All I know is

19:00.700 --> 19:02.090
he was going to find the Xuantian Teachings.

19:02.280 --> 19:03.560
But he never told me

19:03.590 --> 19:04.720
where it is.

19:05.370 --> 19:06.780
Then why didn't he take you with him?

19:10.400 --> 19:11.400
Because...

19:13.030 --> 19:13.750
Mr. Zeng,

19:14.960 --> 19:16.640
since you consider me your master in my previous life,

19:17.070 --> 19:18.200
please answer me truthfully.

19:20.160 --> 19:21.110
Because this time,

19:21.310 --> 19:22.310
there's no turning back.

19:25.070 --> 19:25.750
What?

19:27.200 --> 19:27.920
Back then,

19:28.070 --> 19:29.270
you asked him to seal the Spirit Spring

19:30.110 --> 19:31.240
because you anticipated that he

19:31.240 --> 19:32.020
had reached the peak of Nascent Soul.

19:32.240 --> 19:32.790
One step further,

19:32.790 --> 19:33.960
he could enter the Transcendence Stage.

19:34.510 --> 19:35.960
Then he could use all his power

19:36.030 --> 19:36.920
to seal the Spirit Spring.

19:38.000 --> 19:38.830
But to save you,

19:39.640 --> 19:40.680
he sacrificed half of his core

19:40.830 --> 19:41.680
and a strand of his spiritual soul.

19:42.160 --> 19:43.590
So he couldn't reach the Transcendence Stage.

19:44.360 --> 19:45.560
He can only use his own body

19:45.590 --> 19:46.480
as a spiritual key

19:46.790 --> 19:47.640
to seal the Spirit Spring.

19:50.760 --> 19:51.520
If I find a way

19:51.550 --> 19:52.920
to return Ling Xiao to him,

19:53.410 --> 19:54.410
perhaps he

19:54.440 --> 19:55.310
won't have to die.

19:55.920 --> 19:57.110
Why couldn't he wait for me?

19:59.200 --> 20:00.350
All these years,

20:00.760 --> 20:01.650
he's practiced Ice Lotus Technique

20:01.680 --> 20:02.680
to maintain his cultivation.

20:03.310 --> 20:04.310
The Ice Lotus Technique

20:04.550 --> 20:05.720
is cultivated based on the Unfeeling Mantra.

20:06.550 --> 20:07.440
But his feelings for you...

20:10.440 --> 20:11.110
So,

20:11.310 --> 20:12.810
the Ice Lotus Technique is gradually dissipating.

20:13.680 --> 20:14.680
If he waited any longer,

20:15.070 --> 20:16.000
I'm afraid he wouldn't be able

20:16.000 --> 20:16.960
to suppress the Spirit Spring in the bottle anymore.

20:17.720 --> 20:19.510
'Be as free as a bird,' well said.

20:20.720 --> 20:22.200
He's risking his life to seal the Spirit Spring,

20:22.920 --> 20:24.790
yet he told me to start a new life.

20:26.440 --> 20:27.440
Idiot.

20:33.640 --> 20:34.880
Master Liang's sound transmission talisman.

20:41.160 --> 20:42.000
According to Master Liang,

20:42.310 --> 20:43.400
he has found a way

20:43.400 --> 20:44.000
to return the spiritual soul.

20:45.030 --> 20:46.350
It's also recorded in the Xuantian Teachings.

20:48.720 --> 20:50.270
But where is it?

20:52.510 --> 20:54.990
[Consonance Palace]

20:59.960 --> 21:01.000
I'm Mu Qingge.

21:01.600 --> 21:02.960
Consonance Palace, heed my command.

21:03.240 --> 21:04.400
About what Su Yishui

21:04.480 --> 21:05.680
searched for,

21:06.030 --> 21:06.880
read,

21:07.240 --> 21:08.200
and found out here,

21:08.460 --> 21:09.590
show me everything!

21:22.070 --> 21:23.000
Su Yu

21:23.590 --> 21:25.350
came and took away the Xuantian Teachings.

21:28.030 --> 21:29.550
Master must have gone to the imperial palace.

21:30.480 --> 21:31.440
Master went to the capital

21:31.440 --> 21:32.310
to retrieve the Xuantian Teachings.

21:32.750 --> 21:34.030
I'll set off to find him right away.

21:34.830 --> 21:35.960
I'll help him find a way

21:36.030 --> 21:37.200
to return his spiritual soul.

21:38.880 --> 21:40.480
The journey ahead is likely to be extremely perilous.

21:40.920 --> 21:42.000
Since you've decided to go,

21:42.270 --> 21:43.160
I'll go with you.

21:43.680 --> 21:44.550
No need, Mr. Zeng.

21:45.200 --> 21:46.900
If I miss Master

21:47.030 --> 21:48.000
who returns early,

21:48.350 --> 21:50.310
please make sure to keep him here for me.

21:51.510 --> 21:52.000
Ranran.

21:54.240 --> 21:55.070
We'll go with you.

21:56.070 --> 21:57.200
He's our master too.

21:58.330 --> 21:59.920
We can't possibly join another sect.

22:00.130 --> 22:01.200
Master's affairs

22:01.330 --> 22:02.960
are Wester Sect's affairs.

22:18.720 --> 22:20.030
The capital is just ahead.

22:20.640 --> 22:21.640
But the capital is so big.

22:22.000 --> 22:23.270
Where should we look for Master?

22:24.200 --> 22:24.830
I have a way.

22:27.960 --> 22:28.680
Vermilion Bird.

22:29.070 --> 22:29.310
You...

22:29.480 --> 22:30.790
You've made it your spiritual beast?

22:31.510 --> 22:32.000
No,

22:32.310 --> 22:33.710
I haven't exchanged a soul contract with it.

22:34.310 --> 22:35.590
If it wants to leave one day,

22:35.880 --> 22:36.960
it can just do as it wants.

22:49.480 --> 22:50.110
Found it.

22:56.680 --> 22:58.160
How did you find this place?

22:56.760 --> 22:59.280
[Private mansion, the capital]

22:58.510 --> 22:59.590
Vermilion Bird led us here.

23:00.050 --> 23:00.690
Let's cut to the chase.

23:00.720 --> 23:01.310
Where's Master?

23:02.400 --> 23:03.220
We're looking for him too.

23:03.780 --> 23:05.130
We've lost contact with him.

23:05.510 --> 23:06.200
Mr. Yu,

23:06.680 --> 23:07.960
what's on earth going on?

23:10.340 --> 23:11.030
That day,

23:11.200 --> 23:12.200
we went to the capital.

23:14.640 --> 23:16.110
It just rained heavily.

23:17.590 --> 23:18.790
But it's strange.

23:19.110 --> 23:20.440
How come it only rained over the capital?

23:22.030 --> 23:23.340
It rains every day.

23:23.480 --> 23:24.440
Every single day.

23:24.550 --> 23:25.820
It's rained for over a month.

23:26.400 --> 23:27.680
Sooner or later, the capital

23:27.920 --> 23:29.110
will be flooded.

23:30.240 --> 23:31.350
Rained for over a month?

23:32.400 --> 23:33.070
It has rained since we

23:33.070 --> 23:34.510
returned from Heavenly Meridian Mountain.

23:35.640 --> 23:36.920
That day, the spiritual channel was damaged.

23:38.890 --> 23:39.930
I remember there's a waterway in the moat

23:39.960 --> 23:41.510
that leads directly to the imperial palace.

23:42.510 --> 23:44.000
What exactly is Su Yu up to?

23:48.310 --> 23:48.790
Guardian,

23:48.920 --> 23:49.590
is there anything unusual?

23:50.200 --> 23:51.110
That's a cultivator.

23:52.160 --> 23:53.240
His Golden Core is gone.

23:55.310 --> 23:55.830
There's something wrong

23:56.790 --> 23:57.550
with the moat.

24:02.830 --> 24:05.530
[Ru Yuan]

24:18.240 --> 24:18.790
Young Master,

24:19.160 --> 24:20.510
after so many years without news of you,

24:20.880 --> 24:21.400
I

24:21.750 --> 24:23.000
have finally seen you.

24:24.510 --> 24:25.110
Rise, please.

24:25.830 --> 24:26.920
Prince Ping fell long ago.

24:27.510 --> 24:28.590
I'm not a young master anymore.

24:28.680 --> 24:29.590
Even so,

24:29.920 --> 24:31.030
back then, His Highness

24:31.270 --> 24:32.920
secretly left behind a great fortune.

24:33.440 --> 24:34.960
It would be enough for you to be extremely wealthy.

24:36.030 --> 24:37.270
Why bother going up to the mountain

24:37.510 --> 24:38.750
to suffer the cold and loneliness?

24:39.600 --> 24:40.280
You've hidden your identity

24:40.310 --> 24:41.510
and operated in the capital for many years.

24:41.920 --> 24:43.200
You're also on good terms with many imperial family members.

24:43.510 --> 24:44.960
Is there a way you can get me into the palace?

24:47.740 --> 24:49.720
Guardian, why do you want to enter the palace?

24:50.640 --> 24:52.160
Su Yu has something I need.

24:52.790 --> 24:53.790
I didn't want to trouble you initially,

24:54.400 --> 24:55.640
but today, outside the palace,

24:55.790 --> 24:57.200
I saw he set up a Heavenly Formation at the four corners.

24:57.880 --> 24:58.480
All spiritual power

24:58.500 --> 24:59.960
will disappear once cultivators enter the palace.

25:00.750 --> 25:02.000
I can't use magical techniques to get in or out.

25:03.590 --> 25:04.270
This Su Yu.

25:04.830 --> 25:05.960
He's become more cautious, hasn't he?

25:06.680 --> 25:07.480
In recent years,

25:07.590 --> 25:09.680
the Crown Prince has changed greatly from before.

25:10.340 --> 25:11.060
These past few years,

25:11.270 --> 25:12.790
he has extensively recruited

25:12.960 --> 25:14.750
a group of unique scattered cultivators from the Heavenly

25:15.200 --> 25:16.750
and established an Exotic Pavilion.

25:17.220 --> 25:17.830
Around him,

25:18.000 --> 25:19.350
there are talented cultivators from the Exotic Pavilion

25:19.680 --> 25:20.680
protecting him.

25:21.220 --> 25:22.300
Apart from these cultivators,

25:22.830 --> 25:25.240
no one else can enter or leave the palace.

25:26.400 --> 25:28.310
I've also heard something else.

25:29.070 --> 25:30.200
His Majesty doesn't attend to state affairs.

25:30.400 --> 25:32.400
The Crown Prince has been acting as a regent all along.

25:32.790 --> 25:33.880
But strangely,

25:34.240 --> 25:35.790
informants in the palace have leaked news

25:36.400 --> 25:38.750
that His Majesty intends to depose the Crown Prince.

25:39.680 --> 25:41.160
However, given the Third Prince's abilities,

25:41.490 --> 25:42.840
he's clearly not as good as Su Yu,

25:42.870 --> 25:43.740
and he can't be up to the task.

25:44.590 --> 25:46.350
The remaining imperial heirs are all young.

25:47.110 --> 25:48.160
I don't know why Su Yu

25:48.200 --> 25:50.530
has become suspicious in His Majesty's eyes.

25:52.680 --> 25:54.070
Su Yu isn't that good,

25:55.100 --> 25:56.000
but his younger brothers

25:56.030 --> 25:56.680
are even more incompetent.

25:57.440 --> 25:58.110
However,

25:58.510 --> 25:59.960
has he asked these cultivators from the Exotic Pavilion

26:00.680 --> 26:01.510
to do

26:01.510 --> 26:02.240
anything special?

26:03.510 --> 26:04.240
Young Master,

26:05.120 --> 26:06.400
why do you ask?

26:07.370 --> 26:08.570
Today, as I passed through the capital,

26:09.070 --> 26:10.070
I saw a cultivator

26:10.070 --> 26:11.110
who had drowned in the moat.

26:11.750 --> 26:12.880
His Golden Core is gone.

26:13.440 --> 26:15.790
The previous cultivators who died there

26:16.350 --> 26:17.880
also had their Golden Cores missing.

26:18.270 --> 26:19.550
What does Su Yu want

26:19.550 --> 26:20.200
with so many Golden Cores?

26:21.510 --> 26:22.680
I don't know either.

26:23.240 --> 26:24.830
But the manager of the Exotic Pavilion,

26:24.870 --> 26:25.950
called Feng,

26:26.590 --> 26:27.440
has expanded the small Inquiry Pond

26:27.440 --> 26:28.830
in the palace

26:29.030 --> 26:30.160
into a large lake.

26:31.240 --> 26:32.070
I've also heard

26:32.430 --> 26:32.880
that the day after tomorrow,

26:33.110 --> 26:34.270
a new group of extraordinary talents

26:34.270 --> 26:34.920
will enter the palace.

26:36.200 --> 26:37.750
If you have no other way,

26:37.960 --> 26:39.920
perhaps you could blend in among them.

26:41.510 --> 26:42.110
It is

26:42.790 --> 26:43.830
indeed a way.

26:44.830 --> 26:45.640
But Guardian,

26:46.000 --> 26:47.510
why bother getting involved in these matters?

26:48.060 --> 26:49.080
Clearly, there is

26:49.110 --> 26:50.680
a good life of luxury

26:50.680 --> 26:51.350
waiting for you here.

26:52.480 --> 26:53.960
I've watched you grow up since you were little.

26:54.720 --> 26:55.920
Have you

26:56.240 --> 26:57.160
lost your former vision?

27:14.400 --> 27:15.920
I'm from the Exotic Pavilion.

27:16.230 --> 27:17.000
Do I still need to be verified?

27:16.270 --> 27:18.460
[Bao Ming, Immortal Master of the Exotic Pavilion]

27:17.270 --> 27:17.830
No need, no need.

27:18.030 --> 27:18.440
Please.

27:34.580 --> 27:35.340
Guardian, look.

27:39.000 --> 27:39.510
Guardian.

27:40.000 --> 27:41.590
This Smokescreen won't last more than two days.

27:41.880 --> 27:42.960
Are you sure it's safe?

27:43.830 --> 27:45.070
If I don't come out in two days,

27:45.310 --> 27:46.400
you should return to Mount Wester

27:46.520 --> 27:47.850
and evacuate the disciples immediately.

27:48.070 --> 27:48.550
Guardian.

27:58.400 --> 27:59.000
Next one.

28:14.830 --> 28:15.790
Who goes there?

28:18.820 --> 28:20.130
I am Bao Ming from Mount Suiyun.

28:20.160 --> 28:21.270
I've been invited here.

28:33.510 --> 28:34.160
Previously,

28:34.350 --> 28:35.370
at Wangxiang Pass, I saw

28:35.400 --> 28:37.000
that human corpses merged with fish.

28:37.440 --> 28:38.350
I was wondering

28:38.720 --> 28:39.550
if in this world,

28:40.010 --> 28:41.800
there really exists the Seven Evil Transformation Spell,

28:41.830 --> 28:42.960
such a miraculous spell.

28:44.030 --> 28:45.030
Now that I've met you,

28:45.480 --> 28:46.510
I fully believe it really exists.

28:47.980 --> 28:50.020
I believe His Highness will be delighted

28:50.680 --> 28:51.510
to have such a rare talent as you.

28:53.880 --> 28:55.000
His Highness has been waiting for you for a long time.

28:55.960 --> 28:56.350
Please.

28:57.160 --> 28:57.590
Please.

29:02.270 --> 29:04.480
Within a month, cultivators with Golden Cores

29:04.830 --> 29:07.310
fell into the moat and drowned one after another.

29:07.750 --> 29:08.400
Moreover,

29:08.860 --> 29:10.140
they all lost their Golden Cores.

29:10.510 --> 29:11.270
Could it be that

29:11.830 --> 29:12.720
there's a demon in the moat

29:12.750 --> 29:13.720
specifically eating Golden Cores?

29:14.480 --> 29:15.510
The moat's waterway

29:15.510 --> 29:16.720
flows through the Eastern Palace's Inquiry Pond.

29:17.400 --> 29:18.160
Guardian said

29:18.400 --> 29:19.160
that these strange occurrences

29:19.560 --> 29:20.520
had something to do

29:20.550 --> 29:21.400
with Su Yu.

29:22.030 --> 29:22.920
Young Master Yu?

29:24.270 --> 29:25.400
He killed people and took away Golden Cores.

29:26.110 --> 29:27.750
But he seems so kind and friendly,

29:27.920 --> 29:28.880
caring for the people.

29:29.720 --> 29:31.070
Someone who can become the Crown Prince

29:31.680 --> 29:33.070
is certainly not a simple character.

29:34.700 --> 29:36.370
The Eastern Palace has set up a special formation

29:36.400 --> 29:37.480
to suppress Heavenly spiritual power.

29:38.350 --> 29:39.240
I wonder

29:39.680 --> 29:41.200
how Guardian is doing now.

29:42.070 --> 29:43.430
Let's get into the palace to help Master.

29:43.640 --> 29:44.110
Right.

29:44.680 --> 29:45.920
The Eastern Palace's security is absolutely watertight.

29:46.240 --> 29:47.240
It's not easy to get in.

29:47.680 --> 29:48.590
If we cause a commotion,

29:48.790 --> 29:49.830
it might further implicate Guardian.

29:50.400 --> 29:51.720
So what should we do now?

29:56.720 --> 29:57.240
Don't worry.

29:57.720 --> 29:58.550
We can't get in,

29:58.960 --> 29:59.830
but Vermilion Bird can.

30:01.550 --> 30:02.680
For now, we can only first find out

30:02.680 --> 30:03.440
about Master's situation

30:03.940 --> 30:04.820
and then plan our next move.

30:24.270 --> 30:24.880
Get out!

30:25.340 --> 30:26.560
Spiritual medicine is completely useless!

30:26.920 --> 30:28.070
You're all a bunch of useless trash!

30:28.960 --> 30:30.390
The wound on her face hasn't healed yet.

30:30.680 --> 30:31.510
She's done so many bad things.

30:31.640 --> 30:32.590
It's her own fault.

30:33.310 --> 30:34.070
Your Highness,

30:34.490 --> 30:35.410
the area around Huixiang Spring

30:35.440 --> 30:36.680
has been cleared for you.

30:36.920 --> 30:38.000
They say that the spring

30:38.510 --> 30:40.030
has miraculous effects on healing wounds.

30:40.790 --> 30:41.270
Vermilion Bird,

30:41.550 --> 30:42.640
go look for Master elsewhere.

30:46.240 --> 30:46.660
Hurry!

30:46.810 --> 30:47.610
Has the immortal master arrived?

30:54.270 --> 30:55.160
What's on earth in the water?

30:56.160 --> 30:56.640
They even used such a powerful formation

30:56.640 --> 30:57.830
to suppress it.

31:04.720 --> 31:05.270
Sir,

31:05.790 --> 31:06.270
this way, please.

31:10.550 --> 31:11.750
His Highness is just ahead.

31:15.790 --> 31:17.350
Su Yu is a man of many schemes.

31:17.830 --> 31:18.590
Once he gets his hooks into you,

31:18.750 --> 31:19.640
it's hard to break free.

31:20.440 --> 31:21.310
I need to change my identity.

31:21.920 --> 31:23.100
Finding the Xuantian Teachings is urgent.

31:28.550 --> 31:29.110
Guards.

31:30.790 --> 31:31.240
Yes.

31:44.480 --> 31:45.640
We've found him, Lord Feng.

31:46.680 --> 31:47.160
Lord Feng,

31:47.350 --> 31:47.960
look.

31:53.440 --> 31:53.920
It's not him.

31:54.440 --> 31:55.000
Not him?

31:58.690 --> 31:59.120
Well...

31:59.880 --> 32:00.920
Why is he Master Liu?

32:22.550 --> 32:24.400
[Su Yu's Study, Eastern Palace]

32:26.000 --> 32:26.480
Vermilion Bird,

32:27.070 --> 32:28.000
quickly follow and see.

32:28.480 --> 32:29.440
Don't get caught.

33:13.330 --> 33:14.830
The scent of a thousand-year-old red pine.

33:15.510 --> 33:16.510
This fragrance doesn't dissipate easily.

33:17.830 --> 33:19.240
The books that were once stored here

33:19.480 --> 33:20.510
must still have traces of the woody scent.

33:21.200 --> 33:22.480
I can track its whereabouts by the smell.

33:30.160 --> 33:30.720
How come

33:30.720 --> 33:31.880
it is in Inquiry Pond?

33:40.070 --> 33:42.310
I wrote a letter to invite you here openly,

33:43.000 --> 33:44.480
yet you chose to disguise yourself

33:44.480 --> 33:45.310
and sneak in.

33:46.590 --> 33:47.240
Indeed,

33:48.040 --> 33:49.560
an illegitimate born of a dancer

33:50.310 --> 33:51.960
can never be presentable.

33:56.400 --> 33:57.680
You used Ranran's identity

33:57.680 --> 33:58.270
to lure me here.

33:59.640 --> 34:00.440
What exactly are you up to?

34:01.450 --> 34:01.970
Also,

34:02.490 --> 34:03.930
cultivators in the capital frequently fell into the moat

34:03.960 --> 34:04.660
and lost their Golden Cores.

34:05.510 --> 34:06.000
Is it because of

34:06.030 --> 34:07.310
what you've suppressed in the pond?

34:08.230 --> 34:09.150
What exactly are you trying to do?

34:10.070 --> 34:11.150
How smart

34:12.510 --> 34:13.190
you are.

34:14.000 --> 34:15.710
You spotted the secret in the water at a glance.

34:16.400 --> 34:16.960
However,

34:17.630 --> 34:18.880
you've never seemed to like

34:18.880 --> 34:19.670
meddling in others' affairs.

34:20.360 --> 34:20.800
Why?

34:21.400 --> 34:22.840
Surely it can't be

34:22.840 --> 34:24.000
that you've become Wester Sect's sovereign

34:24.670 --> 34:25.710
and changed your nature, right?

34:28.710 --> 34:29.840
As for Ranran...

34:33.400 --> 34:34.280
Now that I know

34:34.280 --> 34:35.400
her true identity,

34:36.159 --> 34:37.330
I will naturally restore her title

34:37.360 --> 34:38.550
as Madam Battle

34:39.360 --> 34:41.230
and return everything that belongs to her.

34:42.400 --> 34:43.550
I'll let her stay by my side

34:44.290 --> 34:45.290
just like before.

34:45.710 --> 34:46.360
Absolutely impossible.

34:47.000 --> 34:48.070
She is now Xue Ranran.

34:48.090 --> 34:49.150
She has her own life.

34:49.400 --> 34:50.150
Ridiculous.

34:50.670 --> 34:51.800
What gives you the right

34:51.800 --> 34:53.000
to keep Ranran who knows nothing

34:53.020 --> 34:53.870
by your side?

34:54.280 --> 34:55.630
Who was it that harmed her in the first place?

34:56.920 --> 34:57.710
Have you forgotten

34:57.710 --> 34:58.960
what you've done?

35:00.480 --> 35:00.920
She

35:02.010 --> 35:03.040
is the only one in my heart

35:03.070 --> 35:04.800
who can be the Crown Princess.

35:05.590 --> 35:06.320
In this world,

35:07.110 --> 35:08.480
I am the one who truly loves her

35:09.230 --> 35:10.030
and protects her.

35:11.630 --> 35:12.550
I may not be qualified,

35:13.440 --> 35:14.190
but you're even less so.

35:15.040 --> 35:15.890
It seems Su Yishui

35:15.920 --> 35:17.400
doesn't like what others gifted you.

35:18.400 --> 35:19.670
It's a pity about this hairpin.

35:21.670 --> 35:23.320
Although it's not valuable,

35:24.150 --> 35:25.360
it was chosen

35:25.780 --> 35:26.510
with great care.

35:27.480 --> 35:28.230
With your help,

35:29.000 --> 35:30.110
how can we fail in our grand course?

35:33.030 --> 35:33.630
Qingge,

35:34.760 --> 35:36.320
Su Yishui is your disciple.

35:37.510 --> 35:38.070
Why have you

35:39.710 --> 35:40.900
never considered assisting him?

35:43.840 --> 35:44.660
Qingge, be careful!

35:46.630 --> 35:48.000
Back then, you repeatedly used her,

35:48.480 --> 35:49.750
instigating conflict between me and her,

35:50.000 --> 35:51.360
to fulfill your own purposes.

35:52.480 --> 35:53.440
To provoke me,

35:53.800 --> 35:55.150
you didn't hesitate to use her as a pawn.

35:56.230 --> 35:57.190
The love you speak of,

35:57.710 --> 35:58.480
to you,

35:58.960 --> 36:00.190
is nothing but an ornament

36:00.190 --> 36:01.030
beyond power and fame.

36:03.550 --> 36:04.760
If you're asked to trade what you've gained today

36:04.760 --> 36:05.550
for Ranran's love,

36:05.880 --> 36:06.550
will you do it?

36:09.510 --> 36:10.710
How do you know I won't?

36:12.440 --> 36:13.630
If you have the guts, don't hesitate.

36:14.280 --> 36:15.670
The person who can stay by Ranran's side

36:16.510 --> 36:17.190
should be someone

36:17.190 --> 36:18.400
who loves her wholeheartedly.

36:18.880 --> 36:19.800
But you

36:20.640 --> 36:21.520
are simply not worthy.

36:21.550 --> 36:22.150
Shut up!

36:23.550 --> 36:25.190
No one can stop me from getting what I want!

36:25.840 --> 36:26.800
He can't use his spiritual power.

36:27.440 --> 36:28.370
Capture him for me!

36:49.540 --> 36:51.230
He stole Master Liu's Spiritual Power Token.

36:51.960 --> 36:53.670
Don't let him get out of the Eastern Palace.

36:59.440 --> 36:59.920
Master!

37:00.110 --> 37:00.670
Guardian!

37:00.800 --> 37:02.030
Master! Master!

37:03.320 --> 37:04.200
Why are you all here?

37:04.710 --> 37:05.320
Yu Tong, Yu Chen,

37:05.550 --> 37:06.440
quickly take these four away.

37:06.840 --> 37:07.920
Return to Mount Wester immediately. Don't come to find me.

37:09.440 --> 37:10.030
Master!

38:02.360 --> 38:04.280
I've already set up different formations against you.

38:05.010 --> 38:05.520
What you have in your hand

38:05.550 --> 38:06.920
is just a low-level token.

38:07.480 --> 38:08.800
You can't use much spiritual power.

38:10.480 --> 38:11.440
You can't escape now.

38:13.710 --> 38:14.550
Everyone, come on!

38:34.410 --> 38:35.030
This is bad!

38:35.550 --> 38:37.030
The thing in the water can't be suppressed anymore!

38:40.270 --> 38:41.510
Look, what's happening to this water?

38:43.550 --> 38:44.480
Something's not right here.

38:47.840 --> 38:49.070
Quick, let's go! Let's go!

38:53.360 --> 38:54.070
What's going on?

38:54.320 --> 38:56.150
There seems to be uncontrollable malevolent energy in this water.

38:58.760 --> 38:59.190
Your Highness,

38:59.480 --> 39:00.550
the thing in Inquiry Pond can't be suppressed anymore!

39:00.800 --> 39:01.480
In less than 15 minutes,

39:01.590 --> 39:02.960
the capital will be flooded!

39:03.760 --> 39:04.360
What?

39:05.400 --> 39:06.070
Suppress it!

39:39.800 --> 39:40.480
Master!

39:43.490 --> 39:45.290
[Inquiry Pond]

39:48.400 --> 39:50.070
There's so much resentment in the water.

39:51.720 --> 39:52.410
I just discovered that

39:52.440 --> 39:53.840
the Xuantian Teachings is underwater,

39:54.800 --> 39:55.920
but I don't know its exact location.

40:17.290 --> 40:17.880
Dragon.

40:18.410 --> 40:19.890
Su Yu dares to keep a dragon in the palace.

40:20.550 --> 40:21.440
What is he up to?

40:23.660 --> 40:25.560
[Xuantian Teachings]

40:26.710 --> 40:28.070
Su Yu used the Xuantian Teachings

40:28.070 --> 40:28.840
to suppress the dragon.

41:05.070 --> 41:05.620
Could it be...

41:07.960 --> 41:08.500
Master.

41:09.600 --> 41:10.450
Could it be

41:10.480 --> 41:11.550
the dragon egg that Meng Zhang lost?

41:12.470 --> 41:13.670
I never expected to encounter it here.

41:15.520 --> 41:16.520
The soul oath will activate

41:16.550 --> 41:17.280
upon meeting.

41:18.010 --> 41:18.930
If the oath is not fulfilled immediately,

41:18.960 --> 41:19.670
it'll be considered a breach.

41:20.560 --> 41:21.080
It seems now,

41:21.110 --> 41:22.150
whether to honor the soul oath

41:22.440 --> 41:23.670
or obtain the Xuantian Teachings,

41:24.360 --> 41:25.760
I must first tame this Green Dragon.

41:26.280 --> 41:27.670
But its malevolent energy is hard to control right now.

41:28.000 --> 41:28.670
If it's rashly taken out of the palace

41:28.670 --> 41:29.510
without being suppressed,

41:29.840 --> 41:31.110
the entire capital will suffer.

41:40.630 --> 41:41.180
I've come up with an idea.

41:41.920 --> 41:42.800
Spirit-Controlling Soul Separation.

42:05.960 --> 42:06.590
Where is he?

42:11.400 --> 42:12.360
He's not found in the water!

42:13.230 --> 42:14.800
He entered Inquiry Pond and disappeared.

42:15.670 --> 42:16.510
Could he ruin

42:16.510 --> 42:17.150
our grand plan?

42:18.030 --> 42:18.840
Your Highness, rest assured.

42:19.190 --> 42:20.180
In such a short time,

42:20.360 --> 42:21.280
he can't get out.

42:21.630 --> 42:22.590
He must still be somewhere in the palace.

42:25.320 --> 42:26.000
Search!

42:26.230 --> 42:26.960
Yes!

42:31.030 --> 42:32.280
Even if I have to force my way into the Eastern Palace,

42:32.830 --> 42:33.730
I will rescue Guardian!

42:33.760 --> 42:34.230
Wait.

42:35.440 --> 42:36.320
Guardian instructed

42:36.400 --> 42:37.630
to take them away first.

42:38.030 --> 42:38.670
Now those from the Eastern Palace

42:38.670 --> 42:39.840
must be searching for us everywhere.

42:40.440 --> 42:41.400
If we're caught,

42:41.840 --> 42:42.670
Guardian will be in an even worse situation.

42:43.020 --> 42:44.200
Are we just going to do nothing?

42:44.230 --> 42:44.880
Stop arguing.

42:45.960 --> 42:46.920
To save Master,

42:47.670 --> 42:49.150
the formation suppressing spiritual power in the Eastern Palace

42:49.170 --> 42:50.340
is the biggest obstacle.

42:50.920 --> 42:51.880
As long as we break the formation,

42:52.320 --> 42:53.250
it should not be difficult

42:53.400 --> 42:54.110
for Master to escape.

42:54.840 --> 42:56.440
But the Eastern Palace is impregnable.

42:57.110 --> 42:58.150
How can we get in?

43:00.760 --> 43:01.760
Old tricks can still work.

43:02.320 --> 43:03.910
We can use Master's trick of substitution

43:04.190 --> 43:05.280
one more time.

43:05.840 --> 43:06.920
Substitution?

43:07.890 --> 43:08.880
Who are you going to substitute for?

43:11.230 --> 43:12.550
Mu Qingge in the palace.
